02:16:43.893 --> 02:16:44.963
(men laughing)

02:16:44.963 --> 02:16:46.440
- You're just going to
be speaking English.

02:16:46.440 --> 02:16:47.880
- Right, would you not
find the communication

02:16:47.880 --> 02:16:49.395
