02:16:53.053 --> 02:16:54.700
I just didn't know what was going on.

02:16:54.700 --> 02:16:55.533
- Right, right.

02:16:55.533 --> 02:16:57.850
- I'd go, oh yeah. She'd get really angry.

02:16:57.850 --> 02:16:59.118
She didn't speak English very well.

02:16:59.118 --> 02:17:00.600
I didn't speak Japanese
very well at the time.

02:17:00.600 --> 02:17:01.720
Didn't know what we were arguing about.

02:17:01.720 --> 02:17:02.860
- You both just had your phones out

02:17:02.860 --> 02:17:03.851
