02:17:03.851 --> 02:17:04.785
(men laughing)

02:17:04.785 --> 02:17:06.790
- I hate you. Translate.

02:17:06.790 --> 02:17:07.830
- When you think about it in English,

02:17:07.830 --> 02:17:11.170
we have so many ways to
convey levels of upset

02:17:11.170 --> 02:17:13.230
