know what the word magnum?

02:18:22.870 --> 02:18:24.740
How would you know? Who taught you this?

02:18:24.740 --> 02:18:26.200
Who? How do you find this out?

02:18:26.200 --> 02:18:28.130
- I love how he knows the word magnum,

02:18:28.130 --> 02:18:29.932
but not the word for penis.

02:18:29.932 --> 02:18:32.515
(men laughing)

02:18:33.372 --> 02:18:34.205
- It was just the,

02:18:34.205 --> 02:18:36.700
yeah the dichotomy of magnum o-chin chin.

02:18:36.700 --> 02:18:38.180
It was so strange.

02:18:38.180 --> 02:18:39.513
- Sounds like a rock star.

02:18:41.076 --> 02:18:42.370
(men laughing)
Or a rock band.

02:18:42.370 --> 02:18:44.232
- Please welcome, Magnum O-Chin Chin.

02:18:44.232 --> 02:18:46.340
(men laughing)

02:18:46.340 --> 02:18:47.173
- It was great.

02:18:47.173 --> 02:18:48.700
They'd asked me about my
dick size live on stream.

02:18:48.700 --> 02:18:50.384
And I'm like, are you
sure you wanna ask that?

02:18:50.384 --> 02:18:53.209
(men laughing)

02:18:53.209 --> 02:18:54.830
They're good sports though.
They're good sports.

02:18:54.830 --> 02:18:55.663
- It's so good.

02:18:55.663 --> 02:18:59.210
- I learned that there's
also, they have a term,

02:18:59.210 --> 02:19:02.435
