you all the hiragana.

02:20:33.230 --> 02:20:34.680
- What?
- Which blows my mind!

02:20:34.680 --> 02:20:35.513
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

02:20:35.513 --> 02:20:36.346
- It's insane!

02:20:36.346 --> 02:20:37.179
- It did do that.

02:20:37.179 --> 02:20:38.012
I think we've talked about that.

02:20:38.012 --> 02:20:39.420
- That's like teaching you like, algebra

02:20:39.420 --> 02:20:41.080
before you've learned
multiplication, right?

02:20:41.080 --> 02:20:41.913
It's like, why?
- Yeah, it's insane.

02:20:41.913 --> 02:20:43.190
- Yeah, Duolingo's all right, but like

02:20:43.190 --> 02:20:45.700
Human Japanese, really
good app I recommend.

02:20:45.700 --> 02:20:48.120
It is paid for, but there's
like a free light version.

02:20:48.120 --> 02:20:49.100
- I don't mind paying for an app

02:20:49.100 --> 02:20:49.933
if it actually is good.

02:20:49.933 --> 02:20:51.790
- It is really. I used
it for my first year.

02:20:51.790 --> 02:20:53.970
Human Japanese, Human
Japanese Intermediate.

02:20:53.970 --> 02:20:55.460
Everyone I recommended to loves it.

02:20:55.460 --> 02:20:56.580
So if you're learning Japanese,

02:20:56.580 --> 02:20:58.780
you're like really starting
tomorrow afternoon,

